sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Provider (LLM/Platform)
    participant W as Webhook Ingress API
    participant V as Signature Validator
    participant I as Idempotency Store
    participant N as Event Normalizer
    participant R as Raw Events Repo
    participant DLQ as Dead-Letter Queue
    participant EB as Event Bus
    participant L as Logger/Tracing

    Note over P,W: Provider posts signed webhook event

    P->>W: POST /webhooks/provider {headers, body}
    W->>L: log("received", eventId)
    W->>V: verifySignature(headers, body)
    alt valid signature
        V-->>W: ok
        W->>I: check(eventId)
        alt already processed
            I-->>W: seen
            W-->>P: 200 OK
            W->>L: log("duplicate", eventId)
        else new event
            I-->>W: not_seen
            W->>R: storeRawEvent(headers, body)
            R-->>W: rawId
            W->>N: normalize(rawId)
            alt normalization ok
                N-->>W: {type, orgId, teamId?, userId?, ts, data}
                W->>I: markProcessed(eventId, rawId)
                W->>EB: publish(topic="provider.webhook.normalized", payload={type, orgId, teamId?, userId?, ts, data})
                EB-->>W: ack
                W-->>P: 200 OK
                W->>L: log("success", eventId)
            else normalization error
                N-->>W: error(detail)
                W->>DLQ: enqueue({reason:"normalize_error", rawId, detail})
                W->>I: markFailed(eventId, rawId)
                W-->>P: 202 Accepted
                W->>L: log("error", "normalize_error")
            end
        end
    else invalid signature
        V-->>W: fail
        W->>DLQ: enqueue({reason:"invalid_signature", headers})
        W-->>P: 202 Accepted
        W->>L: log("error", "invalid_signature")
    end
